 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "Saturday. You just want a quick car wash. Five euros. Then the gate opens.",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "It's a car wash the size of a stadium. Brushes as tall as houses. And forty thousand fans. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers think: full speed! Straight through, get it over with!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "But the brushes love a fast ball. Bam! Left. Bam! Right. Like a pinball, across the whole pitch.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "And straight into the goal. Upside down. Covered in foam. Brushes one, car nil.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Slowly. Windows up. Hazards on. And drive a lap of honour, like a champion.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "The crowd loves it. A Mexican wave! And the brushes join in.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "Then the show: foam cannons. Water fireworks. And a hairdryer the size of a lorry.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "At the end, a rainbow over the pitch. And your car shines like a trophy.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "So they put it on the podium. Champion of the wash!",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: a double-decker bus, stuck in the tunnel. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
